      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing approximately 10–20 atomic% of Nb, Mo, Ta, and/or W with Ti and/or Zr will produce a continuous BCC matrix containing discrete HCP precipitates.",
