      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::webcard",
        "PMC6105605::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing the fraction of HCP-forming elements can lower dislocation core energy and alter dislocation behavior in refractory high-entropy alloys.",
